  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Primary Education Dev. Programme (PEDP II) - PEDP II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Second Primary Education Dev. Programme (PEDP-II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PEDP II is a national sub-sector programme in primary education. It   has elements of a SWAp - pooled funding, joint reporting, reviewing,  and evaluation. It also includes some parallel funding. Support is    provided by the Government (64%) and 11 Donors (36%). Sida has an     Agreement with GOB, and a co-financing Agreement with ADB. Pooled     funding will be channled through ADB.It covers 61,000 primary schools</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEDP II is a national sub-sector programme in primary education. It   has elements of a SWAp - pooled funding, joint reporting, reviewing,  and evaluation. It also includes some parallel funding. Support is    provided by the Government (64%) and 11 Donors (36%). Sida has an     Agreement with GOB, and a co-financing Agreement with ADB.Pooled      funding will be channled through ADB.It covers 61,000 primary schools</narrative>
  </description>
